  "releaseNotes": "v1.4.0: Select() Projection Support - Added full Select() support for IQueryable<T> with projection to DTOs and computed properties. New D1ProjectionQueryable<TResult> wraps projection results. D1QueryProvider handles expression tree translation for Select(). Supports chaining with Where, OrderBy, Take, Skip before projection. Computed properties enable calculations like IsAdult = Age >= 18. All projection terminal operations supported: ToListAsync, FirstOrDefaultAsync, CountAsync, AnyAsync. 10 new Select() unit tests (132 total). 6 integration test examples. Fully backward compatible.",
